  <note>
New family-specific combining mark; zero advance; explicit anchor placement, including stacking.
Weight master: 展示粗体：184/160，接合只到 156。B 上眼缩到 0.74、下眼留 0.94，腰收 20。比 LihuiT 粗体更重、更收腰，也更需要斜体时的内白回正。
</note>
